BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (The reference below uses Python's standard sqlite3 module and one local SQLite database. Copy the six) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (code cells into one script in their displayed order, or load them sequentially into the same namespace.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (Initialize the schema before starting workers; each worker opens its own connection with identical pragmas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (and never shares a connection between threads. SQLite must live on storage with reliable local locking, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (a casually shared network filesystem. Every business mutation enters BEGIN IMMEDIATE before reading) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (decision state. That serializes competing writers and closes the read-check-write race around state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (advancement, duplicate commission creation, and receipt allocation. A busy worker may receive a lock) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (timeout; its caller retries the same event identifier, never a newly minted identifier. The event receipt stores) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (the complete canonical request and committed response. Replaying the same request returns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (response; changing the payload while retaining its identifier raises an error. Database uniqueness provides) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (a second defense for intake keys, active assets, invoices, earned-fee postings, and bank references.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Restrict database file access to the application account and backups. These guarantees govern this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (single-database write path, not arbitrary direct edits, external escrow systems, or uncoordinated application) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (copies operating separate databases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (The state machine separates commercial readiness from verified evidence. An intake record can advance to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (VERIFIED only after authority, asset identity, condition, lien, and export checks exist. ESCROW_READY) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (additionally requires verified escrow instructions. Issuing the commission invoice requires delivery or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (acceptance evidence satisfying the mandate's earning condition, and all required checks must be current at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (that transaction. The reference uses a seven-day freshness window as an explicit operating assumption; a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (live payoff may require a much shorter deadline. Replace that window with document-specific expiry rules) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (before handling such transactions. Evidence records are append-only in this minimal model, and reviewers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (submit their authenticated identity through the application. The script records that identity but does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (authenticate it. Corrections, refunds, reversals, partial asset releases, and changed mandates require) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (additional versioned workflows; do not bypass constraints to improvise them. A withdrawn deal may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (scrubbed before invoicing, while an invoiced deal requires a proper credit or reversal extension. Purchase) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (principal never enters the ledger. Pair each amount with debit and credit accounts in one row, ensuring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (structural balance without relying on a later process to discover an orphaned journal leg.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (The accounting sequence is deliberately narrow: earning creates a receivable and commission revenue;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (collecting debits operating cash and credits that receivable; paying an operating expense debits expense) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (and credits cash. Amounts are positive integer cents, and the program rejects percentages that produce) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (fractional cents instead of silently choosing a rounding policy. The recognition event requires the full) Tj ET
